    "created_at": "2015-10-07T20:24:11Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-10-07T20:24:11Z",
    "body": "The only concern I have is if Gecko's implementation is sufficiently incompatible that they might benefit from a new type=\"popup\" value to let them make a few backward-incompatible changes. Maybe we could get them to confirm what they'd prefer.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
